<p>Each time you cast a non-instant Demented spell, a nether spark begins orbiting around you for 10 turns, to a maximum of 5. Each spark increases your critical strike chance by 2%, and on reaching 5 sparks your next Nether spell will consume all sparks to empower itself:</p><p><span style="color: #80008b"><span class="tstr-color-PURPLE">Netherblast:</span></span> Becomes a deadly lance of void energy, piercing through enemies and dealing an additional <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">100%, 133%, 159%, 180%, 200%</acronym> damage over 5 turns.</p><p><span style="color: #80008b"><span class="tstr-color-PURPLE">Rift Cutter:</span></span> Those in the rift will be pinned for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 3, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns, take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">71, 96, 115, 131, 145</acronym> temporal damage each turn, and the rift explosion has <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 1, 2</acronym> increased radius.</p><p><span style="color: #80008b"><span class="tstr-color-PURPLE">Spatial Distortion:</span></span> An Entropic Maw will be summoned at the rift's exit for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 5, 6, 6</acronym> turns, pulling in and taunting nearby targets with it's tendrils.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.  Entropic Maw stats will increase with level and your Magic stat.</p>